# CVE-2026-25087: use-after-free in Arrow C++'s IPC reader with pre-buffering
# enabled - not reachable from Python bindings per the advisory itself. Fix
# (pyarrow 23.0.1) has no wheels for this Lambda's Python 3.11 runtime.
CVE-2026-25087

# CVE-2026-23949 (jaraco.context) and CVE-2026-24049 (wheel): both are build
# tooling bundled inside the public.ecr.aws/lambda/python base image's own
# pip/setuptools installation, not runtime dependencies this project
# declares or can bump directly.
CVE-2026-23949
CVE-2026-24049

# CVE-2026-78667, CVE-2026-78669, CVE-2026-97031: Go stdlib (net/http) dentro do
# /usr/local/bin/aws-lambda-rie, o Runtime Interface Emulator que vem na imagem base
# public.ecr.aws/lambda/python. Só é usado fora da AWS (healthcheck/docker-compose
# local); na Lambda real o binário não roda. O fix depende de a AWS republicar a base.
CVE-2026-78667
CVE-2026-78669
CVE-2026-97031
